F10 (carried, rounds 3-5) · CONFIRMED LIVE. isContained() is lexical. A symlink
     inside the officina defeats it:
       ln -s /etc <officina>/ci/escape
       review W-002 --fail --evidence ci/escape/hostname   -> exit 0, recorded
     The identical relation is in rules/paths.ts:119, so this is what D-008
     currently means studio-wide, not a regression W-020 introduced. Tightening
     it to a realpath check changes `check`'s own rule too and belongs in a
     decision. Not a reason to hold this opus; it should not stay open long.

F11 (carried, rounds 3-5) · briefs/W-020.md lists 12 behaviours; the test file
