ON ZERO BLOCKING, SINCE ROUNDS 3 AND 5 BOTH REFUSED TO TREAT IT AS SUFFICIENT

They were right, and the reason they gave is the reason this round can sign.
opus.red_evidence counts files and reads one header, so nine identical
documents satisfied it exactly as well as nine real reds; the counter at zero
proved nothing about the store. What discharges B3 is not that the counter is
still at zero — it is that I took the store apart, rebuilt the capture
independently, and got the same nine documents back. The rule remained
decorative for this defect; the reviewer was the instrument, three rounds
running, and this round is the one where the instrument reads clean.


